                                           &lt;p&gt;After that, go to the Apple M=
enu.&lt;/p&gt;=0A                                                                =
&lt;/li&gt;=0A                                                                &lt;li=
&gt;=0A                                                                    &lt;p&gt;=
In the menu, you have to click the System and Preferences=0A               =
